  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      310.97,
      401.88,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.97,
      401.86,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 135 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in paragraph (e) of subsection(1) of that section, by the substitution for the words andfigures \u201cany offence punishable under section 290A orsection 291B of the Penal Code\u201d, of the words and figures\u201cany offence punishable under section 290A , 291B or 291Cof the Penal Code\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      454.97,
      401.91,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "3.The First Schedule to the principal enactment is herebyamended by the insertion immediately after the entries relatingto section 291B of the following new entries:\u2014",
